{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49434","headline":"女冠子 一 · 薛昭藴","name":"女冠子 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"求仙去也，翠钿金箆尽舍，入岩峦。\n雾卷黄罗帔，云雕白玉冠。\n野烟溪洞冷，林月石桥寒。\n静夜松风下，礼天坛。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"薛昭藴","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_49434.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49434","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}